{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Coin Slot&quot; is a coin pusher game where you can drop a large number of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the left slot, numbers are drawn every 0.1 seconds in a 3x3 grid. When the numbers align vertically, horizontally, or diagonally, coins are dispensed. Additionally, when a ball is dropped, it triggers an increase in the slot level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The numbers that appear in the slot change based on the slot level. At level 1, numbers between 1 and 7 can appear, but at level 5, only the numbers 1 and 2 will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To align 8 lines, it is essential to reach level 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moreover, the slot stops for 0.5 seconds for each line that aligns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A maximum of 960 coins can be dispensed by aligning 8 lines, providing an exciting coin drop experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features an auto-shoot function, and the interval between shots can be adjusted to as little as 0.01 seconds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450220?t=1738932591","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450220?t=1738932591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450220/223b062544ef3abf9ec94f5b20892fa2005ef044/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738932591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450220/223b062544ef3abf9ec94f5b20892fa2005ef044/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738932591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Coin Slot&quot; is a coin pusher game where you can drop a large number of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the left slot, numbers are drawn every 0.1 seconds in a 3x3 grid. When the numbers align vertically, horizontally, or diagonally, coins are dispensed. Additionally, when a ball is dropped, it triggers an increase in the slot level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The numbers that appear in the slot change based on the slot level. At level 1, numbers between 1 and 7 can appear, but at level 5, only the numbers 1 and 2 will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To align 8 lines, it is essential to reach level 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moreover, the slot stops for 0.5 seconds for each line that aligns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A maximum of 960 coins can be dispensed by aligning 8 lines, providing an exciting coin drop experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features an auto-shoot function, and the interval between shots can be adjusted to as little as 0.01 seconds.</p>","developers":["cptyok"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450220/header.jpg?t=1738932591","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257088773,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088773/movie480.mp4?t=1737759235","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088773/movie_max.mp4?t=1737759235"},"name":"\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088773/cacdb4f47ca6327df1618a4835ac10700a278232/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737759235","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088773/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737759235","max":"http://vi